  <artifactId>cairn-testkit</artifactId>
  <name>cairn-testkit</name>
  <description>
    The deterministic simulator, the invariant checker, a second implementation of the rules to
    differ against, and the known flaws that prove the suite can go red. Shipped as main code
    rather than test code so it can be pointed at somebody else's state machine.
  </description>

